OL,3,GNEWSABetter broadband for 11,500 homes
OL,4,Aand businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people in rural areas have
OL,7,Fbeen connected to faster broadband
OL,8,Fthrough a government-backed rollout.
OL,10,FMore than 11,500 premises in Dorset and
OL,11,Fsouth Somerset can now access
OL,12,Fgigabit-capable broadband under Project
OL,13,FGigabit, a scheme to improve
OL,14,Fconnectivity in areas that would
OL,15,Fotherwise miss out.
OL,17,FThe first communities to benefit with
OL,18,Fprovider Wessex Internet include
OL,19,FBeaminster South and Salwayash in
OL,20,FDorset, as well as Aller and Dinnington
OL,21,Fin Somerset.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
