OL,3,GNEWSABetter broadband for 11,500 homes
OL,4,Aand businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project is backed by up to #39m of
OL,7,Fgovernment funding and is expected to
OL,8,Freach nearly 25,000 homes and
OL,9,Fbusinesses.
